{"id": "|344F4BE341EDCBB1A8A1BE991836B049", "source_en": "Always hide the glowing indicators on enemy weapons and attacks during combat, for a more challenging experience.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "إخفاء المؤشرات المضيئة على أسلحة وهجمات الأعداء أثناء القتال دائمًا، لتجربة أكثر صعوبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 5}}
